.TH "unnamed-by-pirro" "6" "2026-11-20" "Unnamed User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
unnamed-by-pirro - run Unnamed, a 4k intro by piRro & fx
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
unnamed-by-pirro
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Unnamed is a 4k intro by piRro and fx, released in 2004 for the 4k
source compo of 320x200.org.
The whole intro, graphics and music included, fits in 4096 bytes of C
source code using SDL 1.2.
.PP
It opens a 400x300 window and quits by itself at the end of the intro.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
Any key
quit the intro (closing the window quits too).
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://320x200.org/2004/4k/
.SH BUGS
.PP
